%% Omni-vite — Sequence: Event creation & the co-sign gate
sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Event Creator
  participant W as Web App
  participant API as Events API
  participant DB as Database
  participant N as Notifications
  actor I as Invited Student

  C->>W: Fill event details, select exactly 10 invitees
  W->>API: POST /events
  API->>DB: Insert Event(status=PENDING_COSIGNS) + 10 CoSignInvitation(PENDING)
  DB-->>API: OK
  API->>N: Notify all 10 invitees
  N-->>I: "Co-sign [Event Title]?"
  API-->>W: Draft created — not yet on dashboard

  loop for each invitee response
    I->>W: Open invite, accept or decline
    W->>API: POST /invitations/:id/respond
    API->>DB: Update invitation status
    API->>DB: Count ACCEPTED invitations for event
    alt count reaches 10
      API->>DB: Set Event.status = PUBLISHED
      API->>N: Notify creator — event is live
    else count below 10
      API-->>W: Still waiting on co-signs
    end
  end
